{"ai_route":{"actual_response_model":"mtplx-flash-next-optimized-speed","ai_run_id":"airun_20261006224217_894f3231","expected_response_model":"mtplx-flash-next-optimized-speed","fallback_chain_id":"aifb_6d416a10c7f3e5fe5345ae0b","fallback_depth":0,"fallback_reason":"","model":"mtplx-flash-next-optimized-speed","provider":"mtplx","reasoning_effort":"xhigh","route_base_url":"http://127.0.0.1:8002/v1","route_identity_hash":"c9480819205db8521fec70763515cf905334434da194fa8ae2172b40ab545075","route_profile_id":"independent_ai__mtplx_qwen38_local","thinking":"enabled"},"ai_run_id":"airun_20261006224217_894f3231","chunk_index":1,"job_id":"mwjob_9343f11db4d5315e1015a081","precondition_digest":"fd463f1e1aabd0939611ea1f881293f2dd4287c62c723b23e502df51e482ae63","project_id":"proj_user_d1d85288693b","schema_version":"protocol_full_draft_chunk_v10","section_ids":["mwsec_greenfield_proj_user_d1d85288693b_93ccaf7f89a876ac","mwsec_greenfield_proj_user_d1d85288693b_d3f72edad544b17a","mwsec_greenfield_proj_user_d1d85288693b_7c64f955bef92c77","mwsec_greenfield_proj_user_d1d85288693b_ab3be1534f1773ab"],"sections":[{"ai_run_id":"airun_20261006224217_894f3231","content_status":"complete","decision_items":[],"evidence_bindings":[{"locator":"study_definition:mwdefinition_85e9e75916689ebcb0bc:revision:6","quote":"总体研究设计：随机、双盲、安慰剂对照、平行组、多中心；II期概念验证+剂量探索，KZ-sGC801三个剂量组与安慰剂对照，治疗12周","quote_sha256":"f2a8e631e4a1175a229080400575878cbefbeff94b7875de0b1db53530513ee3","source_id":"current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_85e9e75916689ebcb0bc:r6:8c60321e314f81b1","span_id":"es1"},{"locator":"study_definition:mwdefinition_85e9e75916689ebcb0bc:revision:6","quote":"目标研究人群：年龄段：成人；疾病状态：中重度；经治情况：经治疗效不佳；18-75岁慢性稳定性HFrEF，LVEF≤40%，NYHA II-III级，稳定GDMT≥4周仍症状未控制","quote_sha256":"de61760938b9f9c46038282a1a5a9cce128034b89ed026e2794dc0b3d2eb0588","source_id":"current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_85e9e75916689ebcb0bc:r6:8c60321e314f81b1","span_id":"es2"},{"locator":"study_definition:mwdefinition_85e9e75916689ebcb0bc:revision:6","quote":"剂量与给药方案：SMOKE-r8-1Z口服sGC刺激剂（KZ-sGC801）：低剂量2.5 mg qd、中剂量5 mg qd、高剂量10 mg qd，每日晨起随餐口服","quote_sha256":"013d1e2be5d470ac82aebaadc122570657aa4202486c6d26b77054f470f36959","source_id":"current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_85e9e75916689ebcb0bc:r6:8c60321e314f81b1","span_id":"es3"},{"locator":"study_definition:mwdefinition_85e9e75916689ebcb0bc:revision:6","quote":"主要终点：第12周NT-proBNP较基线的百分比变化（双盲期）。评价时间点：基线、第4/8/12周。","quote_sha256":"ed3fdeeb458362e8ec2062ccfdb54dabe86146616d3c09971d19582407bead01","source_id":"current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_85e9e75916689ebcb0bc:r6:8c60321e314f81b1","span_id":"es4"},{"locator":"study_definition:mwdefinition_85e9e75916689ebcb0bc:revision:6","quote":"样本量策略：II期探索性设计：每组约60例（共约240例），基于NT-proBNP组间差值文献效应量与80%把握度估算，用于概念验证与剂量选择。","quote_sha256":"5f598e1d608dd27ea2bd6080417002fe0f5e763c866e33ca8a5c13c697490e10","source_id":"current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_85e9e75916689ebcb0bc:r6:8c60321e314f81b1","span_id":"es5"},{"locator":"study_definition:mwdefinition_85e9e75916689ebcb0bc:revision:6","quote":"统计分析策略：FAS为主要分析集；主要终点NT-proBNP百分比变化采用ANCOVA（基线校正）并检验剂量-反应趋势；安全性采用描述统计；次要终点按预先层级顺序分析。","quote_sha256":"9cf37f0df8f4d6bd00beb8c92cebe88f07431911c16227896760d446ca13e075","source_id":"current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_85e9e75916689ebcb0bc:r6:8c60321e314f81b1","span_id":"es6"}],"evidence_review_advisories":[],"evidence_span_ids":["es1","es2","es3","es4","es5","es6"],"evidence_summary":{"corpus_spans":0,"project_fact_spans":6},"gap_items":[],"heading":"方案概要","missing_source_classes":[],"proposal_text":"本研究为一项随机、双盲、安慰剂对照、平行组、多中心II期临床研究，旨在评价SMOKE-r8-1Z口服sGC刺激剂（KZ-sGC801）在慢性稳定性射血分数降低的心力衰竭（HFrEF）成人受试者中的概念验证及剂量探索。研究人群为18至75岁、左室射血分数不超过40%、NYHA心功能II至III级、筛选前已接受稳定剂量指南指导的药物治疗（GDMT）至少4周仍有心衰症状的慢性稳定性HFrEF患者。受试者按1:1:1:1比例随机分配至KZ-sGC801低剂量（2.5 mg每日一次）、中剂量（5 mg每日一次）、高剂量（10 mg每日一次）或安慰剂组，每日晨起随餐口服，双盲双模拟，治疗期12周，所有组别均联合标准GDMT背景治疗。主要疗效终点为第12周NT-proBNP较基线的百分比变化，评价时间点为基线、第4周、第8周和第12周。安全性评价涵盖不良事件与严重不良事件发生率、症状性低血压与体位性低血压、生命体征、肝肾功能及电解质实验室指标、12导联心电图。研究计划入组约240例受试者（每组约60例），基于NT-proBNP组间差值文献效应量与80%把握度估算。主要分析集为全分析集（FAS），主要终点采用ANCOVA（基线校正）并检验剂量-反应趋势，安全性采用描述统计，次要终点按预先层级顺序分析。研究时期包括筛选期（第-28至-1天）、12周双盲治疗期（第0天随机给药至第12周）、治疗结束访视（第12周±3天）及安全随访期（末次给药后2周）。","rationale":"本段正文依据当前项目已确认研究事实中的总体研究设计、目标人群、剂量方案、主要终点、样本量策略和统计分析策略撰写。剂量-反应趋势检验的具体统计方法、安全性评估窗口定义及TEAE采集起止时点需医学负责人依据项目安全性管理计划进一步确认。","review_advisories":["本节复述高影响研究设计（方案概要）；请在合并设计摘要中统一核对。","本节提及高影响设计信息（主要终点、计划入组）；系统未把重复提及升级为强制确认。"],"review_level":"standard","review_reasons":[],"section_id":"mwsec_greenfield_proj_user_d1d85288693b_93ccaf7f89a876ac","section_number":"1","source_ids":["protocol_full_draft_selection:5adf8ca2ff17a5ead64623a2","current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_85e9e75916689ebcb0bc:r6:8c60321e314f81b1","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:04ac0381ef4b49","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:63ce4061f946ca","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:7252de902642cb","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:76a6125fa7dca4","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:fc6f8c9ea6d34b"]},{"ai_run_id":"airun_20261006224217_894f3231","content_status":"source_gap","decision_items":[],"evidence_bindings":[],"evidence_review_advisories":[],"evidence_span_ids":[],"evidence_summary":{"corpus_spans":0,"project_fact_spans":0},"gap_items":[{"action":"检索并纳入HFrEF流行病学、疾病负担、现行诊疗指南及治疗现状来源","category":"source_missing","gap_id":"gap_disease_bg_01","missing_source_classes":["HFrEF流行病学与疾病负担数据","心力衰竭诊疗指南","HFrEF治疗现状文献"],"target":"疾病背景及治疗现状章节正文"}],"heading":"疾病背景及治疗现状","missing_source_classes":["HFrEF流行病学与疾病负担数据","心力衰竭诊疗指南（中国/国际）","HFrEF当前标准治疗现状与未满足需求文献"],"proposal_text":"","rationale":"本章节需要HFrEF流行病学数据（患病率、发病率、疾病负担）、现行心力衰竭诊疗指南及当前标准治疗现状（GDMT组成、未满足需求）等来源方可撰写实质正文。当前允许来源中仅包含疾病名称，无任何流行病学、疾病负担、指南或治疗现状资料。","review_advisories":[],"review_level":"standard","review_reasons":[],"section_id":"mwsec_greenfield_proj_user_d1d85288693b_d3f72edad544b17a","section_number":"2.1","source_ids":["protocol_full_draft_selection:5adf8ca2ff17a5ead64623a2","current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_85e9e75916689ebcb0bc:r6:8c60321e314f81b1","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:04ac0381ef4b49","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:63ce4061f946ca","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:7252de902642cb","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:76a6125fa7dca4","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:fc6f8c9ea6d34b"]},{"ai_run_id":"airun_20261006224217_894f3231","content_status":"partial","decision_items":[],"evidence_bindings":[{"locator":"study_definition:mwdefinition_85e9e75916689ebcb0bc:revision:6","quote":"药物技术类型：small_molecule","quote_sha256":"d8ca21a7e62cbca0e65228c7147e2ce5e59273b60f0d0cc55ed216f48e27710c","source_id":"current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_85e9e75916689ebcb0bc:r6:8c60321e314f81b1","span_id":"es8"},{"locator":"study_definition:mwdefinition_85e9e75916689ebcb0bc:revision:6","quote":"给药途径：口服","quote_sha256":"404b058b755608a73d13b54521a28c02b129df449774d0671b1c3f8b8a5ce42c","source_id":"current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_85e9e75916689ebcb0bc:r6:8c60321e314f81b1","span_id":"es9"}],"evidence_review_advisories":[],"evidence_span_ids":["es8","es9"],"evidence_summary":{"corpus_spans":0,"project_fact_spans":2},"gap_items":[{"action":"补充KZ-sGC801作用机制、非临床药理学及既往临床资料","category":"source_missing","gap_id":"gap_drug_intro_01","missing_source_classes":["作用机制文献","非临床研究数据","既往临床试验报告","研究者手册"],"target":"研究药物简介章节正文"}],"heading":"研究药物简介","missing_source_classes":["KZ-sGC801作用机制详述","非临床药理学与毒理学数据","既往人体临床研究资料","研究者手册"],"proposal_text":"SMOKE-r8-1Z口服sGC刺激剂（KZ-sGC801）为小分子化合物，以口服固体制剂形式给药，产生全身性暴露。本品在本研究中以每日一次口服方式给药，设低剂量2.5 mg、中剂量5 mg、高剂量10 mg三个剂量水平，每日晨起随餐服用，治疗期12周，联合标准GDMT背景治疗。安慰剂为外观与气味与试验药一致的模拟片，每日一次给药，按1:1:1:1随机分配。","rationale":"本段正文依据当前项目已确认研究事实中的药物技术类型（small_molecule）、给药途径（口服）、剂型（口服固体制剂）、暴露范围（systemic）及剂量与给药方案撰写。KZ-sGC801可溶性鸟苷酸环化酶刺激作用机制详述、非临床药理学数据、既往人体研究资料及研究者手册信息尚未纳入，需补充后方可完善本章节。","review_advisories":[],"review_level":"standard","review_reasons":[],"section_id":"mwsec_greenfield_proj_user_d1d85288693b_7c64f955bef92c77","section_number":"2.3","source_ids":["protocol_full_draft_selection:5adf8ca2ff17a5ead64623a2","current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_85e9e75916689ebcb0bc:r6:8c60321e314f81b1","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:04ac0381ef4b49","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:63ce4061f946ca","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:7252de902642cb","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:76a6125fa7dca4","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:fc6f8c9ea6d34b"]},{"ai_run_id":"airun_20261006224217_894f3231","content_status":"source_gap","decision_items":[],"evidence_bindings":[],"evidence_review_advisories":[],"evidence_span_ids":[],"evidence_summary":{"corpus_spans":0,"project_fact_spans":0},"gap_items":[{"action":"补充KZ-sGC801非临床药理学、毒理学及药效学研究数据","category":"source_missing","gap_id":"gap_nonclinical_01","missing_source_classes":["非临床药理学数据","非临床毒理学数据","非临床药效学数据","研究者手册"],"target":"非临床研究结果章节正文"}],"heading":"非临床研究结果","missing_source_classes":["非临床药理学数据","非临床毒理学数据","非临床药效学数据","研究者手册非临床章节"],"proposal_text":"","rationale":"本章节需要KZ-sGC801非临床药理学、毒理学及药效学研究数据方可撰写实质正文。当前允许来源中无任何非临床研究资料，章节当前正文为空。","review_advisories":[],"review_level":"standard","review_reasons":[],"section_id":"mwsec_greenfield_proj_user_d1d85288693b_ab3be1534f1773ab","section_number":"2.3.1","source_ids":["protocol_full_draft_selection:5adf8ca2ff17a5ead64623a2","current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_85e9e75916689ebcb0bc:r6:8c60321e314f81b1","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:04ac0381ef4b49","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:63ce4061f946ca","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:7252de902642cb","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:76a6125fa7dca4","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:fc6f8c9ea6d34b"]}],"source_bindings":[{"content_sha256":"8c81d6bee086e03